 -2026-10-30\n\nThe Hammer Show features Niki Shelley's ceramic works The 
 Idols Fall and Today I Worship the Hammer. Working by hand with stoneware
  and custom glazes in her East Bay studio\, Shelley creates pieces rooted
  in the rituals of daily life. The two works play with the space between 
 the ordinary and the sacred\, giving a familiar tool an unexpected place 
 of reverence. The exhibition is on view at Perish Tr
